      "writtenOn": "2022-11-07T22:39:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming the PE processes the VDM request, then DPM_FLAG_PE_READY would get cleared and the DPM_DFP_READY state would get exited based on the check at the top of that state.\n\nI thought it was better to make it explicit since once a VDM message request is sent the DPM knows that it should go the WAITING state.",
